{"id":"c472b2ba86057172","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-signed-predicate-translation.md","title":"df signed predicate translation","display":"df signed predicate translation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-signed-predicate-translation","aliases":["72-df-signed-predicate-translation"],"display":"df signed predicate translation","depends_on":["[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§2.3.1–2.3.5, print646–647/PDF658–659","verification_status":"source-definition-and-statement-checked; local induction checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note by structural induction and coordinate inverses","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"正式标出否定翻转两个证据坐标的交换律"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-signed-predicate-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-signed-predicate-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df signed predicate translation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§2.3.1–2.3.5, print646–647/PDF658–659"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-statement-checked; local induction checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note by structural induction and coordinate inverses"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"正式标出否定翻转两个证据坐标的交换律"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a> 的签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},a_R\\rangle\\)</span>、非空域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、项和 LP 公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\">\\(\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\)</span> 中两个符号是互异标签。固定单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\times\\{+,-\\}\\hookrightarrow S\">\\(j:\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\times\\{+,-\\}\\hookrightarrow S\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\cup F\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(C\\cup F\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 不交的集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^\\epsilon,\\Sigma^\\pm\">\\(R^\\epsilon,\\Sigma^\\pm\\)</span> 由下式构造，记号省略固定参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_4\\rangle\">\\(M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_4\\rangle\\)</span> 为四值结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_4(R)=R^M\">\\(I_4(R)=R^M\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R^N\\rangle\">\\(N=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R^N\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma^\\pm}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma^\\pm}(N)\\)</span>；其关系解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_R^N(Q)\">\\(I_R^N(Q)\\)</span> 是集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{N,s}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{N,s}\\)</span> 取该文件的完整一阶语义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B\">\\(N,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B\\)</span> 由下式作为同一关系的别名引入。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm\">\\(Q\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 为项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。定义语义别名时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 可遍历全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma^\\pm)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma^\\pm)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^+,A^-\">\\(A^+,A^-\\)</span> 按严格子公式递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^\\pm,N^4\">\\(M^\\pm,N^4\\)</span> 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,I_C,I_F\">\\(D,I_C,I_F\\)</span> 不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR^\\epsilon&amp;:=j(\\langle R,\\epsilon\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm:=\\operatorname{ran}(j),\\\\\na_R^\\pm&amp;:=\\{\\langle j(\\langle R,\\epsilon\\rangle),a_R(R)\\rangle:\nR\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^\\pm&amp;:=\\langle C,F,a_F,\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm,a_R^\\pm\\rangle,\\\\\nJ_M^\\pm(R^\\epsilon)&amp;:=\\{\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}:(R^M(\\vec d))_\\epsilon=1\\},\\\\\nM^\\pm&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J_M^\\pm\\rangle,\\\\\n(R^\\epsilon)^N(\\vec d)&amp;:=\\mathbf1_{I_R^N(R^\\epsilon)}(\\vec d),\\\\\nJ_N^4(R)&amp;:=\\bigl(\\vec d\\mapsto((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d))\\bigr),\\\\\nN^4&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J_N^4\\rangle,\\\\\nN,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow N,s\\models B.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR^\\epsilon&amp;:=j(\\langle R,\\epsilon\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm:=\\operatorname{ran}(j),\\\\\na_R^\\pm&amp;:=\\{\\langle j(\\langle R,\\epsilon\\rangle),a_R(R)\\rangle:\nR\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^\\pm&amp;:=\\langle C,F,a_F,\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm,a_R^\\pm\\rangle,\\\\\nJ_M^\\pm(R^\\epsilon)&amp;:=\\{\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}:(R^M(\\vec d))_\\epsilon=1\\},\\\\\nM^\\pm&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J_M^\\pm\\rangle,\\\\\n(R^\\epsilon)^N(\\vec d)&amp;:=\\mathbf1_{I_R^N(R^\\epsilon)}(\\vec d),\\\\\nJ_N^4(R)&amp;:=\\bigl(\\vec d\\mapsto((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d))\\bigr),\\\\\nN^4&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J_N^4\\rangle,\\\\\nN,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow N,s\\models B.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(R^+)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)&amp;=(R^M(\\vec d))_+,\\quad(R^-)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)=(R^M(\\vec d))_-,\\\\\nR^{N^4}(\\vec d)&amp;=((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d)),\\\\\n(R(\\vec t))^+&amp;:=R^+(\\vec t),\\quad(R(\\vec t))^-:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^+:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^-:=R^+(\\vec t),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)^+&amp;:=(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\doteq u)^-:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^+:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^-:=(t\\doteq u),\\\\\n\\top^+&amp;:=\\top,\\quad\\top^-:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^+:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^-:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^+&amp;:=A^+\\land B^+,\\quad(A\\land B)^-:=A^-\\lor B^-,\\quad(A\\lor B)^+:=A^+\\lor B^+,\\quad(A\\lor B)^-:=A^-\\land B^-,\\\\\n(\\exists xA)^+&amp;:=\\exists xA^+,\\quad(\\exists xA)^-:=\\forall xA^-,\\quad(\\forall xA)^+:=\\forall xA^+,\\quad(\\forall xA)^-:=\\exists xA^-.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(R^+)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)&amp;=(R^M(\\vec d))_+,\\quad(R^-)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)=(R^M(\\vec d))_-,\\\\\nR^{N^4}(\\vec d)&amp;=((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d)),\\\\\n(R(\\vec t))^+&amp;:=R^+(\\vec t),\\quad(R(\\vec t))^-:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^+:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^-:=R^+(\\vec t),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)^+&amp;:=(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\doteq u)^-:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^+:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^-:=(t\\doteq u),\\\\\n\\top^+&amp;:=\\top,\\quad\\top^-:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^+:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^-:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^+&amp;:=A^+\\land B^+,\\quad(A\\land B)^-:=A^-\\lor B^-,\\quad(A\\lor B)^+:=A^+\\lor B^+,\\quad(A\\lor B)^-:=A^-\\land B^-,\\\\\n(\\exists xA)^+&amp;:=\\exists xA^+,\\quad(\\exists xA)^-:=\\forall xA^-,\\quad(\\forall xA)^+:=\\forall xA^+,\\quad(\\forall xA)^-:=\\exists xA^-.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(M^\\pm)^4=M,\\qquad(N^4)^\\pm=N,\\qquad⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=(\\operatorname{val}_{M^\\pm,s}(A^+),\\operatorname{val}_{M^\\pm,s}(A^-)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(M^\\pm)^4=M,\\qquad(N^4)^\\pm=N,\\qquad⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=(\\operatorname{val}_{M^\\pm,s}(A^+),\\operatorname{val}_{M^\\pm,s}(A^-)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\sim A⟧_{M,s}=\\sim⟦ A⟧_{M,s},\\qquad\n(\\sim A)^+=A^-,\\qquad(\\sim A)^-=A^+.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\sim A⟧_{M,s}=\\sim⟦ A⟧_{M,s},\\qquad\n(\\sim A)^+=A^-,\\qquad(\\sim A)^-=A^+.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书IX§2.3定义与Remark2.3.5。最后式逐公式结构归纳：正/负坐标在合取析取与量词处分别对应所显示的双重逻辑操作。两个结构转换直接按R两坐标互逆。逆转换现在直接使用关系的特征函数，避免把任意域元素⃗d未经命名就当成对象语言项。R<sup>-是独立关系，除非另加补集公理，不等于¬R</sup>+。</p>\n<p>本轮扩充复核：对否定正规形的 A 结构归纳。关系字面量交换符号，等式与真假常元交换互补，合取/析取和全称/存在使用 De Morgan 对偶。两套递归采用同一关联顺序，因此正负翻译的两个等式是语法等式。</p>\n<p>2026-10-24：新关系名称由固定单射产生并与常元、函数及变量分离；经典结构使用集合关系，显示的特征函数仅为其0/1接口。经典求值与满足关系直接接到本册已给出的完整一阶语义，不再依赖未声明的“通常解释”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]] 的签名 $\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},a_R\\rangle$、非空域 $D$、项和 LP 公式。$\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}$ 中两个符号是互异标签。固定单射 $j:\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\times\\{+,-\\}\\hookrightarrow S$，其中 $S$ 是与 $C\\cup F\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 不交的集合。$R^\\epsilon,\\Sigma^\\pm$ 由下式构造，记号省略固定参数 $j$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_4\\rangle$ 为四值结构，$I_4(R)=R^M$。$N=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R^N\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]] 的 $\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma^\\pm}(N)$；其关系解释 $I_R^N(Q)$ 是集合。$\\models$ 和 $\\operatorname{val}_{N,s}$ 取该文件的完整一阶语义；$N,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B$ 由下式作为同一关系的别名引入。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\times\\{+,-\\}\\hookrightarrow S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C\\cup F\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"R^\\epsilon,\\Sigma^\\pm","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_4\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"I_4(R)=R^M","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R^N\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma^\\pm}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"I_R^N(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{N,s}","display":false},{"tex":"N,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma^\\pm)","display":false},{"tex":"A^+,A^-","display":false},{"tex":"M^\\pm,N^4","display":false},{"tex":"D,I_C,I_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR^\\epsilon&:=j(\\langle R,\\epsilon\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm:=\\operatorname{ran}(j),\\\\\na_R^\\pm&:=\\{\\langle j(\\langle R,\\epsilon\\rangle),a_R(R)\\rangle:\nR\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^\\pm&:=\\langle C,F,a_F,\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}^\\pm,a_R^\\pm\\rangle,\\\\\nJ_M^\\pm(R^\\epsilon)&:=\\{\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}:(R^M(\\vec d))_\\epsilon=1\\},\\\\\nM^\\pm&:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J_M^\\pm\\rangle,\\\\\n(R^\\epsilon)^N(\\vec d)&:=\\mathbf1_{I_R^N(R^\\epsilon)}(\\vec d),\\\\\nJ_N^4(R)&:=\\bigl(\\vec d\\mapsto((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d))\\bigr),\\\\\nN^4&:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J_N^4\\rangle,\\\\\nN,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B&:\\Longleftrightarrow N,s\\models B.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(R^+)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)&=(R^M(\\vec d))_+,\\quad(R^-)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)=(R^M(\\vec d))_-,\\\\\nR^{N^4}(\\vec d)&=((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d)),\\\\\n(R(\\vec t))^+&:=R^+(\\vec t),\\quad(R(\\vec t))^-:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^+:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^-:=R^+(\\vec t),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)^+&:=(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\doteq u)^-:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^+:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^-:=(t\\doteq u),\\\\\n\\top^+&:=\\top,\\quad\\top^-:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^+:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^-:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^+&:=A^+\\land B^+,\\quad(A\\land B)^-:=A^-\\lor B^-,\\quad(A\\lor B)^+:=A^+\\lor B^+,\\quad(A\\lor B)^-:=A^-\\land B^-,\\\\\n(\\exists xA)^+&:=\\exists xA^+,\\quad(\\exists xA)^-:=\\forall xA^-,\\quad(\\forall xA)^+:=\\forall xA^+,\\quad(\\forall xA)^-:=\\exists xA^-.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(M^\\pm)^4=M,\\qquad(N^4)^\\pm=N,\\qquad⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=(\\operatorname{val}_{M^\\pm,s}(A^+),\\operatorname{val}_{M^\\pm,s}(A^-)).","display":true},{"tex":"⟦\\sim A⟧_{M,s}=\\sim⟦ A⟧_{M,s},\\qquad\n(\\sim A)^+=A^-,\\qquad(\\sim A)^-=A^+.","display":true}],"bytes":4555,"backlinks":[{"id":"86860ecaa6585b53","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$，$D_R^P$ 采用 [[72-df-program-definition-form]]；$\\Sigma^\\pm,R^+,R^-$ 与 $A^+,A^-$ 采用 [[72-df-signed-predicate-translation]]。目标使用 core 的经典公式构造子 $\\to,\\land,\\lor,\\forall,\\exists$；$R^-$ 是独立的正关系符号。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-408","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-signed-predicate-translation|df signed predicate translation]]"},{"id":"141c93aa59eed1f8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"以下断言处于集合论元语言。$M$ 遍历所有集合大小的四值 $\\Sigma$ 结构，$N$ 遍历所有集合大小的普通二值 $\\Sigma^\\pm$ 结构，$|M|,|N|$ 分别是结构的论域分量；常元和函数解释随结构量化。$N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma^\\pm}(N)$；$N,s\\models_{\\rm cl}B$ 取 [[72-df-signed-predicate-translation]] 中接到完整一阶求值的明确别名。理论满足和语义后承由下式展开。$M^\\pm$ 与 $N^4$ 是已定义的互逆结构转换。"}],"outgoing":["40bb12b12b7a39e7","5c014dab66d624c8"]}